                        "review": "the dialogue/narration for the detective is terrible, they made them sound really stupid in this one. the game is also not accepting when i click on a correct hidden object, and i have to go back and click it again several more times to make it register. the directions for some of the puzzles are also too confusing so i don't understand how to do them.\nthis is also the most times i've ever had to press the hint button in dark parables. there are a lot of things on screen that are supposed to be moved out of the way/zoomed in on and they don't look like they should be moved and there's no hinting at what can be moved or not.\nthe end puzzle also has no directions...",
